        "pt": "[NEEDS TRANSLATION]"
      },
      "script": {
        "en": "Not all evidence is equal. Anecdotes are weak. Case studies are better. Controlled experiments are better still. Replicated, peer-reviewed studies are strongest. Know the hierarchy.",
